 document.getElementById('depreciationInfo')?.addEventListener('click',()=>showModal('How the sample estimate works',`<p>When no current quote is entered, this demo applies an illustrative annual category rate to the purchase price. Real resale values depend on the exact model and variant, age, condition, mileage, location, demand and fees.</p><p>For a live product, valuation adapters could request estimates from marketplaces such as Cars24, Spinny, CarWale or Cashify, and show multiple ranges with a timestamp. Real estate would need local comparable data or a professional valuation.</p><p>Depreciation is not a reason by itself to sell. Compare the value you get from keeping an item with the money and effort involved in selling it.</p>`));
 const chatForm=document.getElementById('chatForm');chatForm?.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const input=document.getElementById('chatInput');sendChat(input.value)});
